4 CONT 
4 CONT Registry Header:
4 CONT 
4 CONT B. No. 234 (Banns register No. 201).
4 CONT 
4 CONT Berlin-Niederschönhausen on the twenty-seventh of November, one thousand nine hundred and thirty-five (November 27, 1935).
4 CONT 
4 CONT Before the undersigned civil registrar appeared today for the purpose of marriage:
4 CONT 
4 CONT The Groom (1):
4 CONT 
4 CONT The gardener Heinrich Ludwig Richard Lieber.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Born on the fourteenth of October, one thousand eight hundred and ninety-nine (October 14, 1899) in Trendelburg, Hofgeismar district.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Birth register No. 27 of the civil registry in Trendelburg.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
4 CONT 
4 CONT The Bride (2):
4 CONT 
4 CONT Maria Emilie Erna Ibe, without profession.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Born on the sixth of June, one thousand nine hundred (June 6, 1900) in Cassel.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Birth register No. 1114 of the civil registry in Cassel I.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
4 CONT 
