4 CONT 
4 CONT 4. The gardener Hugo Krüger.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized by identity card.
4 CONT 
4 CONT 44 years old, residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Eichenring 2.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Marriage Declaration (Printed Text):
4 CONT 
4 CONT The civil registrar asked the betrothed individually and one after the other the question: whether they wish to enter into marriage with each other.
4 CONT 
4 CONT The betrothed answered this question in the affirmative, and the civil registrar then pronounced that by virtue of the Civil Code they are now legally joined spouses.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Signatures:
