3 PAGE Shows the filed marriage declaration of Marie Ibe Erna and Gardener Heinrich. from the Niederschönhausen registry office, where the marriage was recorded in 1935 (from Berlin State Archives).
3 DATA
4 TEXT Page 1: Marriage Details
5 CONT Source:
5 CONT 
5 CONT Top Right Blue Stamp (Death Declaration):
5 CONT 
5 CONT The husband has been declared dead.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Time of death: December 31, 1945.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Legally binding decision of the Schöneberg local court in Berlin-Schöneberg dated December 13, 1960.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Berlin, August 6, 1965. Head of the civil registry.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Registry Header:
5 CONT 
5 CONT B. No. 234 (Banns register No. 201).
5 CONT 
5 CONT Berlin-Niederschönhausen on the twenty-seventh of November, one thousand nine hundred and thirty-five (November 27, 1935).
5 CONT 
5 CONT Before the undersigned civil registrar appeared today for the purpose of marriage:
5 CONT 
5 CONT The Groom (1):
5 CONT 
5 CONT The gardener Heinrich Ludwig Richard Lieber.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Born on the fourteenth of October, one thousand eight hundred and ninety-nine (October 14, 1899) in Trendelburg, Hofgeismar district.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Birth register No. 27 of the civil registry in Trendelburg.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
5 CONT 
5 CONT The Bride (2):
5 CONT 
5 CONT Maria Emilie Erna Ibe, without profession.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Born on the sixth of June, one thousand nine hundred (June 6, 1900) in Cassel.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Birth register No. 1114 of the civil registry in Cassel I.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Page 2: Witnesses, Signatures, and Children
5 CONT Source:
5 CONT 
5 CONT Witnesses:
5 CONT 
5 CONT As witnesses were called in and appeared:
5 CONT 
5 CONT 3. The gardener Richard Scherfling.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Identity recognized by identity card.
5 CONT 
5 CONT 28 years old, residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser-Wilhelm-Str. 67.
5 CONT 
5 CONT 4. The gardener Hugo Krüger.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Identity recognized by identity card.
5 CONT 
5 CONT 44 years old, residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Eichenring 2.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Marriage Declaration (Printed Text):
5 CONT 
5 CONT The civil registrar asked the betrothed individually and one after the other the question: whether they wish to enter into marriage with each other.
5 CONT 
5 CONT The betrothed answered this question in the affirmative, and the civil registrar then pronounced that by virtue of the Civil Code they are now legally joined spouses.
5 CONT 
5 CONT Signatures:
5 CONT 
5 CONT Read aloud, approved, and signed:
5 CONT 
5 CONT Heinrich Lieber
5 CONT 
5 CONT Erna Lieber née Ibe
5 CONT 
5 CONT Richard Scherfling
5 CONT 
5 CONT Hugo Krüger
5 CONT 
5 CONT The civil registrar. (Signature/Stamp)
5 CONT 
5 CONT Bottom Left Margin Notes (Children):
5 CONT 
5 CONT A daughter born. No. 1318 / 1937 Berlin-Pankow.
5 CONT 
5 CONT A son born. No. 296 / 1939 Berlin-Pankow.
