2 CONT 
2 CONT 10 July 1661 - Created 1st Baronet Guise of Elmore, Brockworth and Rendcombe, Gloucestershire, by King Charles II. 
2 CONT 
2 CONT source: Burke's Extinct and Dormant Baronetcies.
2 CONT 
2 CONT Latin inscription on marble tomb in Chancel states he died 1670 at age 53. Monument dedicated by only son and heir, John Guise
